OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786376897
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of attempted
OL,4,Cmurder
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof attempted murder after an incident
OL,8,Fthat saw a car mount a pavement in a
OL,9,FBristol street.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,Fscene on Stokes Croft around 6.30am
OL,13,Fthis morning (Sunday, August 9) after
OL,14,Fa crash following 'an incident of
OL,15,Fdisorder'.
OL,17,FA dramatic video shared with
OL,18,FBristolLive shows a car being driven
OL,19,Ferratically mounting the pavement on
OL,20,FStokes Croft as pedestrians were
OL,21,Fwalking down the street.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
