OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786376897
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of attempted
OL,4,Cmurder
OL,6,FTwo of the three people suffered non-
OL,7,Fserious injuries, but one person was
OL,8,Ftaken to hospital.
OL,10,FTheir injuries are not believed to be
OL,11,Fas serious as initially thought,
OL,12,Fpolice added.
OL,14,FA cordon remains in place and members
OL,15,Fof the public are told there will be
OL,16,Fan increased police presence in the
OL,17,Farea.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
