CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786376897
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of attempted
OL,4,Cmurder
OL,6,FThomas Street, Hepburn Road, Stokes
OL,7,FCroft, and City Road remain closed
OL,8,Fthis afternoon and motorists are asked
OL,9,Fto avoid where possible.
OL,11,FA nearby business was also damaged
OL,12,Fduring the incident, police confirm.
OL,14,FA man, who is believed to be the
OL,15,Fdriver of the car, has been arrested
OL,16,Fon suspicion of attempted murder and
OL,17,Fdangerous driving.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
